        <mxCell id="_afVUXXgETafG0vhBlnX-70" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;strokeColor=#808080;strokeWidth=0.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(204, 255, 230);&quot;&gt;Partition specified in the ProducerRecord &lt;/span&gt;-&amp;gt; Use that specific partition directly, ignoring the key.&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 230, 204);&quot;&gt;No partition specified, but a key is present&lt;/span&gt; -&amp;gt; Hash the key and apply the modulo operation (as described above).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;Neither partition nor key is specified &lt;/span&gt;-&amp;gt; Distribute records in a round-robin/Sticky Partitioner fashion to balance the load evenly.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
